.TH WALLPAPER\-SUITECTL 1 "2026-08-04" "wallpaper-suite" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wallpaper\-suitectl \- command-line client for the Wallpaper Suite GNOME Shell extension
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wallpaper\-suitectl
.BR status " [" \-\-json ]
.br
.B wallpaper\-suitectl
.BR next " [" \-\-wait "] [" \-\-json "] [" \-\-no\-reset\-timer "] [" \-\-request\-id
.IR ID "] [" \-\-timeout " " SECONDS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wallpaper\-suitectl
drives the Wallpaper Suite extension over its versioned
.B dev.norvi.WallpaperSuite1
session D\-Bus interface.
.PP
The extension must be enabled in the running GNOME Shell session for any
command to succeed; there is no fallback that renders wallpapers without it.
Enable it once per user with:
.PP
.RS
.B gnome\-extensions enable wallpaper\-suite@spencercnorton.github.io
.RE
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Report the API version, whether the extension is active, whether a render is
in flight, whether scheduled rotation is enabled, and the identifier of the
current operation, if any.
.TP
.B next
Advance to the next wallpaper. By default this also resets the rotation timer,
and returns as soon as the request is accepted rather than waiting for the
composite to be published.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Print machine-readable JSON instead of human-readable text.
.TP
.B \-\-wait
Wait for the operation to reach a terminal state and exit non-zero if it did
not publish.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-reset\-timer
Advance the wallpaper without moving the next scheduled rotation deadline.
.TP
.BI \-\-request\-id " ID"
Supply a caller-chosen identifier. Re-sending the same identifier is
idempotent: the existing operation is joined rather than a second one started,
which makes retries safe.
.TP
.BI \-\-timeout " SECONDS"
Bound the D\-Bus call. Defaults to 30 seconds.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The command succeeded. With
.BR \-\-wait ,
the operation also published.
.TP
.B non-zero
The extension was unavailable, the arguments were rejected, the call timed
out, or a waited-for operation ended without publishing.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/gnome-shell/extensions/wallpaper-suite@spencercnorton.github.io
The system-wide extension installed by this package.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/wallpaper-suite
Rendered composites and the runtime status document.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gnome-extensions (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Spencer Norton.
